sn5.8:1.6 | S: “I don’t approve anyone’s creed, sir.” | T: “I don’t approve of anyone’s creed, friend.”
sn5.8:2.1 | S: “In whose name did you shave your head? | T: “Under whom have you shaved your head?
sn5.8:2.2 | S: You look like an ascetic, | T: You do appear to be an ascetic,
sn5.8:2.3 | S: but you don’t approve any creed. | T: Yet you don’t approve of any creed,
